{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ChessBoxing Championship is the ultimate test of strategy and strength.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a unique fusion of tactical chess and intense boxing, where every move on the board is just as important as every punch in the ring. In Career Mode, create and customize your fighter as you face 50 increasingly challenging opponents on your climb through the chess boxing division.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and develop your character in your personal gym. Improve your stats in both chess and boxing, and sharpen your skills through dedicated mini-games, whether it's spotting the best move on the chessboard or perfecting your timing with boxing combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new outfits, arenas, and abilities as you progress. Equip powerful passive and active skills across both disciplines, and unleash special moves during chess matches and boxing rounds to gain an edge over your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're planning five moves ahead or dodging a knockout punch, every decision matters. Will you rise to become the ultimate chess-boxing champion?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Scholar's Mate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3897470/300bd9ee9e0704828598c39677006f61175d37e9.jpg"},{"name":"Mind Over Muscle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3897470/2d79f82e9c3e760a753868353e4da93bba8a6db9.jpg"},{"name":"Endgame Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3897470/1a9f2080518086bd815ec4000a7277613f458fd2.jpg"},{"name":"Knightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3897470/c75d63aefc6e587bab709af3ba62a441ac21a49b.jpg"},{"name":"Drawn Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3897470/bebd6250f02548d07a1a70141afa777bbe9ac5a1.jpg"},{"na